# Path of the Snake: modules, actions and items.

ninja-module-snake-johyo = Johyo
ninja-module-snake-johyo-desc = Summons a chain kunai. The shot pulls the target to you and briefly stuns it.
ninja-module-snake-healing-cocktail = Healing Cocktail
ninja-module-snake-healing-cocktail-desc = Three charges of a healing reagent. Recharges with 10 sheets of plasma.
ninja-module-snake-emergency-teleport = Emergency Blink
ninja-module-snake-emergency-teleport-desc = Instantly teleports you to a random safe spot ahead.
ninja-module-snake-caltrop = Caltrop
ninja-module-snake-caltrop-desc = One press places a single energy caltrop behind you. The caltrop burns and knocks down anyone who steps on it until it is destroyed. At most three caltrops can be active on the station at once, and placing the third one puts the ability on cooldown.
ninja-module-snake-second-chance = Second Chance
ninja-module-snake-second-chance-desc = Once prevents your death and revives you in place. There is no third chance.

