ninja-caltrop-limit = There are already three active energy caltrops on the station.
ninja-caltrop-no-room = There is no room to place a trap here.

johyo-phrase-1 = Come here!
johyo-phrase-2 = Heel!

ninja-inject-healing-cocktail = The suit injects a healing cocktail. The wounds are closing.
ninja-second-chance-used = The suit runs the second chance protocol and brings you back to life.

reagent-name-chiyurizine = chiyurizine
reagent-desc-chiyurizine = A complex medical reagent that speeds up tissue regeneration and restores blood.
